la</span>:\t\tI know! They've been in love for so long. They've shared so many experiences together. In fact, they still find the time to do new things. There is always something for them to do out on the town. Don't you think it's wonderful to have a soulmate?"}, {"id": 2, "image": "engenn8le01ob05re2img02.jpg", "time": "25000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:\t\tI guess ... I thought I found my soulmate when I met Camilla. We got along so well. Of course, it wasn't meant to be. Don't you think that successful relationships are rare these days?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Paula</span>:\t\tI'm not sure I agree. I've met many happy couples. Of course, I've also comforted many girlfriends after their breakups. I think it's important to be clear about what you want in a relationship as early as possible. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:\t\tThat's true. No one really understands my passion for comics and movies, for example. In fact, most of my dates have been fiascos because of that."}, {"id": 3, "image": "engenn8le01ob05re2img05.jpg", "time": "60000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Paula</span>:\t\tYou have to admit that it's a very specific conversation topic. Don't you think you should branch out a little? <br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:\t\tI tried that, of course, but it didn't work either. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Paula</span>:\t\tYou sound desperate.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:\t\tOf course I do! It's not easy being a geek!"}], "coverimg": "engenn8le01ob05re2img05.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn8le01ob05re2aud01"}}], "title": "", "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "_data": []}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}]}]}